{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-04_end","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-04","title":"探查岩洞区域","storyCode":"14-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-04_end.txt","sourceHash":"69c4b333246cfea7d71be26c4de720e3187f11bf2a8bac87a24b3d016e9cb57b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"W在与雇佣兵携手战胜诡异怪物后，只身闯入了与赦罪师有关的古老遗迹内部。被俘虏的厄尔苏拉抓住了时机，从赫德雷的手中逃脱。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g18_originiumcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"长相恐怖的怪物 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1335_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（怪异的嚎叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咱们的武器一点用都没有！该死的......这怪物是死不掉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞄准一点打！往它的脑袋上招呼！我就不信它能有多结实！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它动作也太快了！根本瞄不准！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吸引一下它的注意力！我从它背后试试！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"想要偷袭的佣兵绕到了怪物庞大的身躯背后，怪物只是甩了甩尾巴，便将他摔到了岩壁上，轻松得就像赶走身上的跳蚤。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"连续的攻击没能对它造成什么伤害，巨大的振翅声响起，炽热的风狂乱地冲击着山洞里的一切，让空气更加稀薄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"土石震动，尖刺拔地而起，冲向在场的所有人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吵死了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"短腿蛾子！安静点！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"长相恐怖的怪物 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1335_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（吟唱般的鸣叫）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"怪物第一时间锁定了伤害的来源，庞大的身躯完全不影响它动作的敏捷。\n只是换了一次弹的工夫，怪物已经冲到了W面前，利牙几乎贴到了她脸上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道......是谁把你生成这副样子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但想吃我，你的这张丑脸，得长得再大一点才行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是吃炸弹吧！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它......死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脸都炸烂了，活不了了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你没事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一向很擅长把控炸弹的距离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我有个猜测，W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会不会萨卡兹以前有个失落的王庭叫炸弹魔，你是炸弹魔王庭最后的公主之类的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，真好笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这到底是什么玩意？看上去可不像什么正经动物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说哥伦比亚有些疯子会把好几种动物的身体缝到一块去——该不会是他们搞的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不巧的是，我还听说过一批会做类似事情的萨卡兹疯子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）有巫术的味道，赦罪师造出来的怪物吗......为什么会在这种荒山野岭里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种东西出现在这肯定不是巧合，山洞里面估计还有别的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我们的人，是被这个东西......吃了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就只能剖开肚子来检查一下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个东西，是死透了吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这家伙还是成群的吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们把洞口堵住了！W！现在咋办！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"行动开始后四十八小时"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g2_giantmonsterspine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几点了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面的时间对你来说还有意义吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行行好吧，就当是我的职业病，知道时间心里会踏实点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下午六点，离我们坠落在峡谷里过去了两天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......两天。够做很多事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷，你还记得吗？有一次，我们三个接了一个去偷什么萨尔贡帕夏秘宝的任务，我们偷到了东西，结果被一百来号人追杀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们躲到了一个山洞里，也是整整两天。饿着肚子，不敢生火，不敢出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我还记得是伊内丝帮你缝的伤口，不然你很可能挺不过那时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈。那时候我说，天快亮了，让我晒会太阳呗，这样伤好得更快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定阻止你了。敌人还在外面，我们不能暴露行踪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是你阻止我，是伊内丝笑话我。她说，疤痕商场的佣兵，居然会贪恋太阳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"疤痕商场隐藏在卡兹戴尔地区的地下，确实不见光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后来我当了军事委员会的军令长，“少校”，得到了驾驶这具骸骨的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"带着那帮年轻人在卡兹戴尔和伦蒂尼姆之间穿来穿去的时候，别说晒太阳了，日光都像是被抛到我们身后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我不可能回到过去的日子里了。萨卡兹都回不去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......厄尔苏拉？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骸骨？动起来了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"恍惚之间，巨兽骸骨仿佛重新动了起来。但很快，赫德雷意识到在动的并非神经束和骨片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......钉子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......船长和船，本来就是一体的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"组成“生命脊椎”的，从来就不止巨兽的遗骸，还有这一排排钉在骨架上，用来将死去的生物组织组装成“运输船”的长钉。\n其中有一枚，钉住了脊椎上最关键的一节。她的法术浸润过它。\n她和这具骸骨，本来就已被巫术连接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王庭军侦察术师的法术连接到了这具骸骨，我能感觉到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别着急，它还不会醒过来，但凭借这一点连接，还有这枚钉子上存留的巨兽的能力，够我离开这了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这枚钉子本来就是我的，我的骨头和它连着呢，我就带走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨兽的能力直接作用在人身上会怎么样呢？偶尔找回一点过去的疯，感觉也还不错。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脊骨在裂开......不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，赫德雷，你会为你的选择后悔的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......又或者说，你会将这一切都当作历史中避无可避的一部分？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"重剑穿刺裂隙，替代那枚掉落的长钉，堪堪撑住了脊椎最关键的部位。\n而只是这一瞬间，他们的囚犯就已经挣脱了铁链。\n厄尔苏拉从肋骨的碎裂处跳了出去，和骨片还有损坏的神经纤维一起，被持续不断燃起的火光吞没。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厄尔苏拉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“厄尔苏拉”......漂泊在历史碎片中，醉心于救人的英雄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我有没有同你说过，这个名字可能更适合你？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g17_wunderpass"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"长相恐怖的怪物","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（愤怒的嘶吼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它们到底有多少只！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W！前面好像是死路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也没打算从前面逃，我只是给我的炸药，留点空间——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卧倒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们......被炸死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望炸下来的那几块石头够砸碎它们的脑袋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们为什么会守在这里？是在保护什么东西吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我哪知道！你们是不是真的觉得我能和怪物聊得来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......所以，我们应该是真的发现了什么不得了的东西？“吊塔”他们应该也是被这种怪物吃掉的吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别咒我......我还活着呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还活着！什么情况？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我们来这边巡逻的时候发现这里有个洞穴，担心里面有什么密道之类的怪东西，就来检查了一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"结果遇到了那几个怪物！“轮胎”“刺盾”“螺母”全都被吃了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的人拼了命地跑，不知道为什么那几个怪物一点也不敢往这边追，我们也没法出去，结果被困到了现在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死的，一会我要去把那几个怪物的皮剥下来送给伊内丝做衣服......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们在里面发现了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看，向那个方向走，过了那几个蒙面死人，再往右边的分岔，我都布置了记号——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒙面死人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"几具骷髅，有年月没人动过了，估计是几年前从伦蒂尼姆跑出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"要说有什么奇怪......他们都把自己的角砍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"砍去双角的......蒙面尸体？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，把脑袋包得严严实实，大概是哪个部族的传统？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈的。不是你们疯了，就是我疯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你得罪过的老熟人？别那么紧张，他们都死得不能再透了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"带我去看，马上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g17_wunderpass"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，就是这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"到底怎么了，W？我从没见你这个样子过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"数具尸体倚靠着洞壁，W俯下身去，仔细检查着这几个死去已久的人，不放过任何一处可能是线索的痕迹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"衣服下的身体都已经高度白骨化，都是重伤致死，没什么疑问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的遗体似乎当年就被人整理过，估计是他们的同伴？不过看这些灰尘，都已经是好几年前的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，墙角还有个小祭坛，没有巫术的痕迹，应该只是单纯用来纪念的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只有他们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们......这些刺客怎么会在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有这里的几具？这附近还有没有其他的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"什么意思，还该有谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"W！喂，W！你又发什么疯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"到底怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"刺客？W说这些人是刺客？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g17_wunderpass"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"W，等等我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“吊塔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"这附近我们都看过了，没其他可疑的东西——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的衣服......我认识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些该千刀万剐的叛徒......他们本该死干净了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们在这里，就意味着——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，不可能的！简直荒唐透顶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......W，我听说，特蕾西娅殿下的遗体被......从巴别塔偷走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别问我！我怎么知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅殿下在巴别塔遇袭之后再次露面，就是在伦蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里......离伦蒂尼姆很近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴，我不需要你提醒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来怎么办？我们是不是应该......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们回去，告诉伊内丝，战备等级提到最高，其他的她会处理好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要把这些年一直没做完的事情......收拾干净。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无角的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有意义了，佣兵，我们之间的战斗毫无意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无角的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战争已经结束了！我们之间的生死不会对既定结果产生一丝一毫的影响！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_1343_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说没意义就没意义了？你手上沾着她的血！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_1343_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，还有你的同伙，活着的那些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_1343_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会找到你们所有人，不管你们逃到什么地方，我都会找到你们，把你们的骨头一根根地抽出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无角的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的罪孽，我比任何人都要清楚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无角的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算今天没有在这里遇到你，我也会自己了断自己的性命！你觉得你来动手能平息你那不值一提的愤怒的话，就动手吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无角的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么样，你来迟了，佣兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无角的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你救不了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_1343_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他妈的，给我闭嘴！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"我承认我犯过很多错，但至少在这件事上，我绝不会犯错。\n当年的叛徒我已经杀完了，我记得他们每个人的死法，甚至是最后的表情，但为什么还有人会死在这？\n凯尔希说过，殿下是被赦罪师“复活”的，他们为什么还需要一个活着的特蕾西娅？\n除了特雷西斯要冒充萨卡兹的伟大领袖的计划，他们还有什么打算？\n真是够了......特雷西斯，赦罪师，我对你们的脑子里的怪点子没有兴趣，但你们玷污了一位绝对不该玷污的人。\n所以你们每个人都得死，我发誓！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他妈的，这究竟是什么鬼地方？这里还有扇门？\n给我......炸开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g6_sarkazancientruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......什么东西......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"难以想象，狭窄的洞口连接的是这样一个宽阔的山洞，终年不见天日的洞穴里阴气逼人，遍地皆是蒙尘的甲胄与武器。\n怪异的结晶体点缀在整个空间之中，熟悉又陌生的巨大纹样从墙面一直延伸到地下，涂画着让人胆寒的符号。\n恍惚间，W生出一种怪异的感觉，她觉得并非是自己在打量周遭的一切，而是......这巨大的地下结构正在凝视着她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"铛——\n钝器相撞的声音响彻洞穴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"铛——铛——\nW听出来了，那是重物劈碎骨头的声音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何人......造访......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
